# No instructive copy (JobseekerModule)

Do **not** add guiding or instructional sentences on screens.

## Forbidden

- Intro / subtitle paragraphs under page titles (e.g. “Opportunities you have submitted…”, “Complete opportunity details step by step…”)
- Helper blurbs above forms, tabs, tables, or embedded lists (e.g. “Complete the remaining details…”, “These candidates were nominated by…”, “Please complete your profile to unlock…”)
- Step-by-step coaching copy next to tab headings

## Allowed

- Page / section / tab **titles** and field **labels**
- Validation / error messages
- Empty-state and load-error messages
- Server-provided legal text (e.g. disclaimer body) when required by the flow
- Auth/marketing copy on login & registration only when the product explicitly requires it

## When editing existing screens

Remove instructive intro/subtitle paragraphs rather than rewriting them. Keep the heading and the interactive content.
